#: src/admin_trait.php:1151
msgid ""
"Unmatched payments are detected blockchain transactions to your wallet addresses that could not "
"be automatically matched to an MCC order. Review the currency, amount, receiving address, and "
"transaction ID, then verify the transaction on-chain before deciding whether it belongs to a "
"customer order."
